<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 6.95 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 6.95 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 6.95 percent on Sunday from 7.61 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said three banks traded on the market in eleven reported transactions with a total value of 13.85 million dinars ($19.6 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
